-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §18 מורה לחינוך מיוחד: a special-education
-- teacher (in a special-education school, a regional support centre, a
-- therapeutic centre, or a special-education class of an ordinary school)
-- works §§15–17's week, with smaller individual groups and the stay hours
-- spent on the work special education asks.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `18 מורה לחינוך מיוחד`

-- The opening: §§15–17 apply with the changes below, so the hours of the
-- week are the primary or junior-high teacher's.
@ref akn:art_18
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a special-education teacher's full week` stage IS
    IF stage EQUALS `a primary school` THEN `a week of` 26 5 5 ELSE `a week of` 23 4 9

-- (א)(1): individual hours with a group of up to 3 pupils ("המונה עד 3",
-- 3 included, as in §15(ג)), or one pupil;
-- (2): their content is the principal's, under the Ministry's general
-- instruction for special-education schools.
@ref akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a special-education group for individual hours` pupils IF
    pupils AT LEAST 1 AND pupils AT MOST 3

-- (ב)(1): work meetings up to 2 weekly hours in a primary school and up to
-- 4 in a junior high school (meetings with other teachers about shared
-- pupils and with outside bodies among them); (2): the rest of the stay
-- hours on the seven activities listed.
@ref akn:art_18__para_b akn:art_18__para_b/p2 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_1
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `special-education work meetings a week at most` stage IS
    IF stage EQUALS `a primary school` THEN 2 ELSE 4

@ref akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p4 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p5 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p6 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p7 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2/p8
DECLARE `special-education stay activity` IS ONE OF
    `fitting the curriculum and the learning environment to the pupil`
    `individual meetings with parents`
    `checking work and examinations`
    `preparing for and sitting on placement, support and integration committees`
    `planning and guiding the special-education assistants' work`
    `coordinating with bodies outside the school to integrate the pupil in the community`
    `coordinating continuity between frameworks of study`

#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`a special-education teacher's full week` `a primary school`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `hours of the week` (`a special-education teacher's full week` `a junior high school`) EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `a special-education group for individual hours` 3
#ASSERT NOT `a special-education group for individual hours` 4
